---
---

<!-- SECTION: Misión, Visión y Horarios — dark navy palette -->
<section class="relative z-10 overflow-hidden" style="background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a3d52 0%, #0d4a6b 100%);">

  <!-- Decorative grid overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-5"
    style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 40px, #fff 40px, #fff 41px), repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, transparent 40px, #fff 40px, #fff 41px);">
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 border border-white/20 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-4">
        <span class="text-amber-400 text-xs">💪</span>
        <span class="text-white/80 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase">Quiénes somos</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
        Nuestro <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text" style="background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #FFB923, #ffd97a);">Propósito</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
        En Arena Voleibol Club, nacimos de un sueño: llevar el vóley playa a otro nivel en Perú. Más que un club, somos una comunidad que vive y respira este deporte.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Mission + Vision cards (left 2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-1 flex flex-col gap-6">
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-amber-400 shadow-[0_8px_40px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_48px_0_rgba(255,185,25,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" style="background: rgba(255,185,25,0.12);">
              <span class="text-lg">🎯</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Nuestra Misión</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Guiado por entrenadores profesionales, te brindamos las herramientas y la técnica para desatar tu verdadero potencial en la cancha.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-l-4 border-arena-cyan shadow-[0_8px_40px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_48px_0_rgba(27,158,170,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" style="background: rgba(27,158,170,0.12);">
              <span class="text-lg">🌊</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Nuestra Visión</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Transformar vidas a través del vóley playa, masificando este deporte como herramienta de salud y calidad de vida para más peruanos.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Schedule card (right 2 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_8px_40px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] h-full">

          <!-- Card header -->
          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a3d52 0%, #0a5b8a 100%);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-lg">📍</span>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-white">Entrena en Chorrillos</h3>
                <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">Playa Agua Dulce</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <!-- Grupales -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl p-5" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <span class="text-base">👥</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Entrenamientos Grupales</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mb-3">Únete y entrena con otros apasionados del vóley playa.</p>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mb-4">
                <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold text-xs">Lun, Mié, Vie y Sáb</p>
                <p class="text-amber-500 font-bold text-xs">6:30 AM — 8:30 AM</p>
              </div>
              <a href="#contacto" class="w-full inline-block text-center text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg active:scale-95" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B9EAA, #0a5b8a);">
                ¡Quiero Inscribirme!
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Personalizados -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl p-5" style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                <span class="text-base">⚡</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Entrenamientos Personalizados</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mb-3">Plan a tu medida para acelerar tu progreso.</p>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 mb-4">
                <p class="text-gray-900 font-semibold text-xs">Horarios Flexibles</p>
                <p class="text-amber-500 font-bold text-xs">previa coordinación</p>
              </div>
              <a href="#contacto" class="w-full inline-block text-center text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg active:scale-95" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a3d52, #0a5b8a);">
                Solicitar Información
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>